^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ unsigned zero: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ long long minimum: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ unsigned long long maximum: SUCCESS$
